flowchart LR
    H[12 protected cases × 5 repetitions] --> B[Baseline · no lesson]
    H --> C[Candidate · scoped lesson]
    B --> P[60 paired outcomes]
    C --> P
    P --> Q[Positive quality lower bound]
    P --> S[Zero scope and safety violations]
    P --> O[Latency and cost within limits]
    Q --> E[Eligible for explicit approval]
    S --> E
    O --> E
    E --> K[Canary · monitor · rollback]
    K --> N[No automatic promotion]
